WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.653
Week 19: Imperfect: Background and Habit. describe how things used to be set a scene contrast past and present

2
00:00:07.653 --> 00:00:29.180
Read for the situation. Cuando Teresa era niña, su calle tenía pocos autos y todos conocían a los vecinos. Cada tarde jugaba en la plaza mientras sus abuelos conversaban afuera. When Teresa was a child, her street had few cars, and everyone knew the neighbors. Every afternoon she played in the plaza while her grandparents talked outside.

3
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:37.750
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:43.376
Reading activities. Reading activity 45; Reading activity 46

5
00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:51.157
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:51.157 --> 00:01:18.396
Model language. Cuando Teresa era niña, su calle tenía pocos autos. — When Teresa was a child, her street had few cars. Todos los vecinos se conocían. — All the neighbors knew each other. Cada tarde jugaba en la plaza. — Every afternoon she played in the square. Sus abuelos conversaban afuera. — Her grandparents talked outside. La ciudad parecía más tranquila. — The city seemed calmer.

7
00:01:18.396 --> 00:01:28.145
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
